  "text": "I'll start by reading the ego-browser skill and the job input so the transport run stays inside the documented browser path.Skill is loaded. Next I’ll inspect the job directory, input, and the wait/clipboard helpers before opening ChatGPT.I’ll glance at the job metadata, then open ChatGPT in a dedicated task space.Opening ChatGPT in a dedicated task space and inspecting the visible composer UI.The account is signed in. I’ll open the model picker and record the highest visible reasoning mode.The heading opened Settings. I’ll close it and use the composer’s “6 Pro” control as the model picker.The picker only showed a tooltip. I’ll screenshot and try the Ctrl+Shift+M reasoning-level shortcut.The “6 Pro” control is a menu. I’ll click it and wait until the reasoning-level options appear.Pro is already the top reasoning level. I’ll open model selection so the receipt can record the exact visible labels.Highest mode is already Pro. I’ll close the menu, attach `input.md`, and send the Korean request.I’ll upload `input.md` through the “사진 및 파일 추가” control.Attachment is in place. I’ll type the Korean request, send it once, and write the submitted receipt immediately.Prompt and attachment are ready. I’ll send once, then write the submitted receipt.The prompt is in. I’ll save the submitted receipt, then lock in the stop and response selectors.Receipt is saved. Next I’ll inspect the live message DOM for the stop and response selectors.Selectors are set: stop is `답변 중지`, response is the assistant message. I’ll start the 15-minute wait helper.The long wait was killed. I’ll rerun the same helper in 60-second foreground slices and keep the existing conversation.Still pending with no assistant text. I’ll keep the same wait helper running in another bounded slice.Still thinking, no assistant text yet. I’ll keep the same helper running for another 5 minutes.Zero characters after several waits. I’ll do one compact selector check, then continue the same helper if it’s still generating.It's still working — the thinking label is now “도입 장면을 설계함”. I’ll keep the same wait helper going.The wait helper reports a stable 21,732-character response. I’ll inspect the Copy control and two distinctive text anchors before capturing.Copy control is `응답 복사`. I’ll capture via the clipboard helper and confirm UI copy success before writing the plan.The helper failed. I’ll inspect its copy log in the job directory before deciding whether to retry the same capture path.The first copy click didn’t show success. I’ll bring the response Copy button into view, then retry the same helper.The Copy button is in view. I’ll retry the same clipboard helper and check for a copy-success icon change.Copy succeeded in the UI (`응답 복사됨`), but the clipboard didn’t match the anchors. I’ll wait after the checkmark, then retry with shorter distinctive phrases.The Copy button confirms in the UI, but the clipboard helper still misses the observed anchors. I’ll record that helper failure and leave the live conversation for recovery.I’ll write the failed receipt and compact snapshot, then leave the live ChatGPT conversation in place for recovery.Receipt is written. I’ll leave the ChatGPT task space open so the conversation can be recovered.Transport failed at clipboard capture. The ChatGPT turn itself finished; `plan.md` was not written.\n\n- **Mode:** Pro (slider 5/5). Visible model radio: 최신. Composer pill: 6 Pro.\n- **Submitted once** to https://chatgpt.com/c/6aa088c2-fed8-83ee-a7e9-80d5284bc6e7\n- **Generation:** wait helper `stable`, 21732 characters. Stop control gone. Copy control: `응답 복사`.\n- **Capture:** `planning-clipboard.py` exit 1. UI showed `응답 복사됨`, but pbpaste did not contain the observed anchors. Last helper receipt: `plan.md.51133.receipt.json`.\n- **Not done:** no DOM reconstruction, no second submission.\n- **Evidence:** `web-receipt.json` status `failed`; `web-snapshot.txt`; helper copy logs in the job directory.\n\nOperator can recover the existing conversation from that URL. Task space 9 was left open.",
